{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"第一眼落在左上方的大号白字标题，紫色强调词“那些气不该忍”很醒目；随后视线容易被中下方另一组同样醒目的大号白字和蓝色强调词“没了力气”“只觉得难受”吸引。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他仍对过去受的气感到不服，如今已经不在那些人身边；两部分需要结合才能明确处境。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"不服气、疲惫、难受。\",\n  \"missed\": \"过去开心的事也不敢多想；不服气逐渐消退的原因，以及从过去的委屈转向如今失落的心理变化。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"两块同样显眼的大号标题争夺主视线\",\n    \"核心意思分散在上下两块，需要拼接才能理解情绪变化及其关系\",\n    \"单块较长，包含过去受气、回忆、自我责备等多个层次\",\n    \"放大的强调词本身不能独立说明完整处境\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4244da3a-2bb3-4a42-bf5e-4587c723b08b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T012835796946Z", "elapsed_seconds": 23.14, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:28:58.933311+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "20677435cba63e3be6d23831047fcd785ca9805f1dfbae40264fa8d791d20776", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", 